ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi117: GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET containing EDGE_LOOP with 2 edges; e1: LINE (0,0,0)→(5,0,0) tangent (1,0,0) at endpoint; e2: B_SPLINE_CURVE_WITH_KNOTS degree-3 (cubic Bezier); control points P0=(5,0,0), P1=(5,0,0), P2=(8,3,0), P3=(10,0,0); P0==P1 => zero derivative C'(0)=(0,0,0) at start IS singular-derivative defect; FixNotchedEdges samples tangent angle but encounters degenerate zero-length tangent vector and silently fails; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty; all EDGE_CURVEs ARE wired into EDGE_LOOP; never orphaned */
